---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | SGVTurf" description="Plain-language information about how SGVTurf uses homeowner and contractor intake data." canonicalUrl="/privacy/">
  <Nav /><main id="main-content"><PageHero eyebrow="Privacy Policy" description="A concise explanation of the information SGVTurf collects through its forms and why." meta={['Last updated August 22, 2026', 'Limited referral sharing', 'Plain language']}><span slot="title">Privacy for project briefs<br /><em>and applications.</em></span></PageHero><section class="surface-section surface-section--white"><div class="section-shell article-body"><h2>Information submitted</h2><p>SGVTurf receives the fields you choose to submit in a homeowner brief, contractor application, or contact form. It may also receive source information such as UTM campaign fields and common advertising click identifiers.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to respond, organize a project brief or application, operate and measure the funnel, prevent spam, and improve the resource. Homeowner project information is shared with a limited number of potentially relevant independent contractors only when the homeowner gives the consent disclosed beside the form.</p><h2>Independent recipients</h2><p>Independent contractors control information they receive under their own practices. SGVTurf does not guarantee their availability, licensing, pricing, suitability, workmanship, or handling of a later direct relationship.</p><h2>Data minimization and delivery</h2><p>Forms request only information needed for the stated flow. Submitted personal information is not included in analytics events. If the configured delivery service does not confirm receipt, SGVTurf does not show a success state. Do not submit sensitive financial, identity, or payment information.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Use the <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact form</a> for privacy or data-use questions.</p><p>This page is general information, not legal advice.</p></div></section></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
